                                "sense_id": "b0297658-283e-384d-b6d4-a5391bce6be4",
                                "text": "Another \"ia\" was evolving here, she felt, to send Mrs. Goodchild scuttling delightedly: nephophobia, a terror of clouds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b07803d1-51f8-41d1-8a01-0013cae49028",
                                "sense_id": "b0297658-283e-384d-b6d4-a5391bce6be4",
                                "text": "Lions, Tigers and Clouds….Oh My...Is it possible, you wonder, that I have Nephophobia?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fc5ffd4-17ce-4ebe-b3e6-11cdf693c039",
                                "sense_id": "b0297658-283e-384d-b6d4-a5391bce6be4",
                                "text": "Natural environment phobias include weather-related conditions such as fear of thunderstorms (astrophobia), clouds (nephophobia), hurricanes (lilapsophobia), snow (chionophobia), cold (cryophobia), wind (ancraophobia), and rain (ombrophobia), among others."
